collatz←{⎕IO←0                      ⍝ longest Collatz chain among starts m..n-1 → steps start
     m n←⍵
     s←(2⌈m)+⍳n-2⌈m                 ⍝ the starting numbers (1 is excluded)
     step←{v s i last←⍵             ⍝ live values, their starts, steps so far, latest finishers
         o←2|v
         v←(o×1+3×v)+(~o)×v÷2       ⍝ one Collatz step for every live value at once
         k←1≠v                      ⍝ which chains are still running?
         f←(~k)/s                   ⍝ starts whose chain just reached 1
         (k/v)(k/s)(i+1)((0=≢f)⊃f last)
     }
     v s i last←step⍣{0=≢⊃⍺}s s 0 ⍬ ⍝ repeat until no chain is left running
     i,⊃last                        ⍝ number of steps, and the smallest start that needs them
 }
